  "description": "Hardware keyboard listener and key control for .NET MAUI and .NET 10: KeyDown/KeyUp events, keyboard shortcuts, application hotkeys, mouse and pointer input, Android gamepad and D-pad controls, WebAssembly browser input, native macOS AppKit events and tvOS Apple TV Siri Remote buttons.",
