  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Experimental preview: opt-in Android Activity and Windows subtree capture, per-window scoped routing, repeat policies and native event metadata. Fixes Android legacy listeners swallowing native input and Windows Select mapping. Includes eight platform assets and browser module. Partial Android TV/Windows native runtime validation; physical peripherals, complete lifecycle, post-fix Windows Select runtime and MAUI 11 runtime acceptance remain unverified. Not production-ready.",
